</nav>

<header class="hero page-section active" data-page="home">
  <div class="hero-content wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">
      <span>The Verse FM</span>
      <span class="signal-mid" id="signalMid"></span>
      <span>Broadcasting Now</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">A world within its own — bringing you love, life, and new music.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">A creative platform, community, and cultural movement built on radio, live experience, and artist discovery — grounded in patience, faith, and the belief that the work done in private becomes the harvest seen in public.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas">
      <a href="#player" class="btn btn-primary">Tune In Live</a>
      <a href="#duality" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ticker-wrap">
    <div class="ticker">
      <span>ON AIR — THE VERSE FM</span>
      <span>CREATION · COMMUNITY · OPPORTUNITY</span>
      <span>DISCOVERY · CULTURE · CONNECTION</span>
      <span>A WORLD WITHIN ITS OWN</span>
      <span>ON AIR — THE VERSE FM</span>
      <span>CREATION · COMMUNITY · OPPORTUNITY</span>
      <span>DISCOVERY · CULTURE · CONNECTION</span>
      <span>A WORLD WITHIN ITS OWN</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="about page-section" id="about" data-page="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="duality-head">
      <div class="section-label">About</div>
      <div class="section-title">The whole story, in one place.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-intro">
      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="label">The Verse</div>
        <h3>The dream, the culture, the public-facing world.</h3>
        <p>A creative platform, community, and cultural movement dedicated to celebrating music, storytelling, and authentic expression — creating space for artists and audiences to connect through love, life, creativity, and sound.</p>
        <p><strong>Mission:</strong> to cultivate a world where music, creativity, and community intersect — empowering artists and audiences through authentic storytelling, meaningful experiences, and cultural discovery.</p>
        <p><strong>Vision:</strong> to become a globally recognized cultural platform that inspires creativity, amplifies diverse voices, and creates opportunities for artists to thrive beyond traditional boundaries.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-block">
        <div class="label">Verse Entertainment</div>
        <h3 class="plum">The infrastructure behind the dream.</h3>
        <p>A full-service record company committed to building sustainable careers and lasting creative legacies — equipping creators with the resources, knowledge, and infrastructure to thrive within the music industry.</p>
        <p><strong>Mission:</strong> to provide artists with the knowledge, resources, and strategic support necessary to develop their craft, protect their creations, and build sustainable careers.</p>
        <p><strong>Vision:</strong> to become a trusted leader in artist development and creative empowerment — a music industry where artists are educated, protected, and positioned for long-term success.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-head">
      <div class="section-label">The Verse — Brand Pillars</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pillars">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon">D</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Discovery</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Introducing audiences to emerging artists, sounds, and perspectives.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon">C</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Community</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Creating meaningful connections between creators, listeners, and industry professionals.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon">C</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Creativity</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Celebrating artistic expression in all its forms.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon">C</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Culture</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Preserving and advancing the stories, traditions, and innovations that shape music.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon">O</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Opportunity</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Opening doors for artists and creatives through education, exposure, and access.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid-head">
      <div class="section-label">Verse Entertainment — Core Values</div>
    </div>
    <div class="values">
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon value-icon">S</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Stewardship</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Treating creativity as an asset worthy of protection and intentional management.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon value-icon">E</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Education</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Knowledge creates independence and opportunity.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon value-icon">I</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Integrity</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">Transparency and ethical business practices guide every decision.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon value-icon">P</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Partnership</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">We grow alongside our artists, not merely on their behalf.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pillar">
        <div class="pillar-icon value-icon">E</div>
        <div class="pillar-name">Excellence</div>
        <div class="pillar-desc">We pursue quality in both artistry and execution.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="tag-rows">
      <div class="label">The Verse Is</div>
      <div class="tag-row">
